lease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nLi Ming and Zhao Li are colleagues in the same team. They both desire an important promotion opportunity. To make the leader believe they are the most suitable candidates, Li Ming exaggerates his past achievements during the meeting. After seeing this, Zhao Li intentionally encourages Li Ming to submit a promotion application during the meeting but secretly gathers evidence of Li Ming's exaggerations.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Zhao Li encourage Li Ming to submit a promotion application?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Zhao Li wants to prove her leadership position in the team.\nB. Zhao Li wants to confuse Li Ming to make him think she really supports his promotion.\nC. Zhao Li affirms the contribution Li Ming makes in the team.\nD. Zhao Li hopes the leader thinks she is good to her colleagues.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0024725116601140977,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af58f599aa9dc5a833d657d","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794477913018,"createTime":"2026-11-12 18:05:13","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"878a4ac766304644ace15443a98cf512"}